WEBVTT

00:36.110 --> 00:37.820
Miss Shigure.

00:38.950 --> 00:41.910
You've grown so quickly
since I last saw you.

00:43.040 --> 00:45.120
Mr. Yasubei?

00:46.040 --> 00:51.920
I heard that you were heading toward
the Yagyu village so I came to meet you.

00:52.300 --> 00:53.140
Me?!

00:53.170 --> 00:54.340
Yes.

00:55.130 --> 00:58.890
It seems that we've made
you take a very difficult journey.

01:00.310 --> 01:04.890
But your difficult
journey will end here.

01:12.940 --> 01:14.990
Prepare to meet your death!

02:45.540 --> 02:50.290
<i>(Episode!) A Dragon Within.</i>

02:57.090 --> 02:59.050
What is the meaning
of this, Yasubei?

03:00.880 --> 03:06.470
Do you know what the crest
on your necklace means?

03:11.850 --> 03:16.440
That is the royal crest of
the lost ancient kingdom.

03:18.820 --> 03:24.290
Back when you were a child, the Yagyu
Clan did not trust the Tokugawa government,

03:24.320 --> 03:28.790
so we secretly brought you up
just in case you may be useful.

03:30.330 --> 03:32.870
But the situation has changed.

03:33.790 --> 03:37.640
Today, the Yagyu Clan is the most
trusted clan serving under the Shogunate,

03:37.670 --> 03:39.590
thus your existence is
now a hindrance to us.

03:41.170 --> 03:47.810
Moreover, I hear that Yamikubo, the enemy
of the Tokugawa government, is after you.

03:48.600 --> 03:51.450
So that's why you
are going to kill me.

03:51.480 --> 03:53.350
It cannot be helped.

03:53.850 --> 03:55.990
The least I can do
is to end your life

03:56.020 --> 03:58.530
instantaneously so
that you will not suffer.

04:17.170 --> 04:19.050
How melodramatic.

04:19.550 --> 04:20.550
What?!

04:21.260 --> 04:23.680
You're so corny, I
can't help but laugh.

04:24.890 --> 04:29.680
Hey, boss. If you're speaking
of the least you can do,

04:30.430 --> 04:33.060
how about letting the woman
go and disemboweling yourself.

04:33.520 --> 04:36.190
Now that's called kindness.

04:36.400 --> 04:38.400
. You!
- Stop!

04:39.570 --> 04:43.860
If you don't leave now, you leave me
no choice but to take your life as well.

04:49.030 --> 04:52.000
You think you can take my life?

04:53.120 --> 04:56.430
Five of you had to come
out just to kill one woman.

04:56.460 --> 04:58.460
Silence, you lowlife.

05:07.340 --> 05:10.890
Quit posing and get on with it.

05:29.320 --> 05:31.160
That's it?

05:32.490 --> 05:35.160
So this is the extent
of Yagyu's skills.

05:37.620 --> 05:38.920
How disappointing.

05:40.250 --> 05:41.920
What are you doing?!

05:43.550 --> 05:44.760
Go!

06:03.230 --> 06:04.780
Easy, now.

06:05.780 --> 06:07.450
Your swordsmanship
is extraordinary.

06:08.360 --> 06:10.040
Which school?

06:10.070 --> 06:11.950
Don't have any.

06:13.990 --> 06:16.580
By the way, are you strong?

06:18.160 --> 06:21.460
I want to fight with an
extremely awesome fighter.

06:23.340 --> 06:27.470
That you will know as
the swords are crossed.

06:30.140 --> 06:31.600
You're right.

06:48.740 --> 06:51.200
Those guys— Where
have they gone?

07:08.760 --> 07:09.760
<i>He's quick.</i>

07:13.800 --> 07:15.350
Don't bother.

07:16.060 --> 07:18.060
You'd be safer with me.

07:19.020 --> 07:22.650
There may be more
Yagyu guys roaming nearby.

07:25.730 --> 07:26.730
Not too shabby!

07:32.070 --> 07:34.740
Your swordsmanship is
just about equal to mine.

07:37.450 --> 07:41.840
I'm so happy, I can't wait.

07:41.870 --> 07:43.170
Don't insult me.

07:50.260 --> 07:51.550
<i>| 901 you!</i>

08:07.770 --> 08:11.780
Oh, man, we came so close.

08:18.410 --> 08:22.960
When will I ever be
able to lose this thing?

08:24.170 --> 08:27.920
Hey, you know anyone
who's really strong?

08:34.180 --> 08:38.850
Well, then, shall we go, before
more of them come chasing after us?

08:56.570 --> 08:58.910
Who are you?

08:59.700 --> 09:01.840
The name is Zofu.

09:01.870 --> 09:03.460
A Hiruko ninja.

09:04.540 --> 09:06.920
Are you going to kill me?

09:07.380 --> 09:08.470
Huh?

09:08.500 --> 09:11.000
Why would a Hiruko
want to do that?

09:12.550 --> 09:15.470
I guess you know
absolutely nothing.

09:17.510 --> 09:19.550
I shall inform you, then.

09:20.310 --> 09:21.930
Nothing better
to do but kill time.

09:23.310 --> 09:28.620
First, the Dragon Stone, which
both the Hiruko and Kimon are after.

09:28.650 --> 09:34.160
That has the map to the treasures
of the lost ancient kingdom.

09:34.190 --> 09:37.220
Hiruko's aim is to take
the treasure and use

09:37.250 --> 09:40.450
it to fund the creation
of a brand new nation.

09:40.870 --> 09:43.300
- Nation?!
- Yeah.

09:43.330 --> 09:46.800
A new nation where we Hiruko
people who have lived in darkness

09:46.830 --> 09:50.000
for a very long time can
live with dignity and respect.

09:52.130 --> 09:54.920
We need you to be there for us.

09:57.720 --> 09:59.150
Me?

09:59.180 --> 10:02.010
We need your royal lineage.

10:04.020 --> 10:09.530
What? I don't know
what to make of this.

10:09.560 --> 10:11.490
I can't believe it.

10:11.520 --> 10:15.940
I don't blame you, but you are the person
who is destined to be Hiruko's leader.

10:17.150 --> 10:20.380
The Hiruko people have been
in the shadows for too long.

10:20.410 --> 10:24.340
We could use some light.

10:24.370 --> 10:26.470
And you are our light.

10:26.500 --> 10:28.500
I refuse!

10:29.960 --> 10:32.600
I am just an ordinary woman.

10:32.630 --> 10:34.800
I am not the kind of
person who can be so

10:34.830 --> 10:37.350
audacious as to lead
some group to a rebellion.

10:37.380 --> 10:40.550
I simply want to
lead a normal life.

10:41.890 --> 10:43.890
Normal, huh?

10:55.400 --> 10:59.240
If you feel that way,
I'll have to oblige.

11:57.960 --> 12:00.300
I love campfires.

12:01.260 --> 12:03.180
You're a pushy fellow.

12:10.680 --> 12:12.850
I hear you're a tough swordsman.

12:13.900 --> 12:18.400
I've been looking forward to
meeting you for a long time...

12:19.530 --> 12:21.440
Mr. Jubei Kibagami.

12:23.030 --> 12:25.490
And what do you want?

12:26.070 --> 12:28.460
Come now, don't rush.

12:28.490 --> 12:31.790
Let's enjoy the beautiful moon.

12:37.880 --> 12:40.560
I am Zofu of the Hiruko Clan.

12:40.590 --> 12:42.920
Mind if I tell you a
little story of mine?

12:43.550 --> 12:46.890
You'll talk anyway
even if I said no.

12:49.100 --> 12:54.190
There was this princess that
I adored for a very long time.

12:55.520 --> 12:59.330
And this princess was about to
be ambushed by the Yagyu Clan.

12:59.360 --> 13:02.250
- Yagyu?
- Yeah.

13:02.280 --> 13:07.090
So I slayed them and
saved the princess.

13:07.120 --> 13:10.950
Then the moment that I'd been
waiting for, meeting the princess, arrived.

13:13.500 --> 13:15.540
I was devastated.

13:16.370 --> 13:18.350
That princess...

13:18.380 --> 13:21.550
She had totally turned
into an ordinary girl.

13:22.340 --> 13:26.220
She said she wanted the
happiness of an ordinary life.

13:27.090 --> 13:29.720
I got so mad.

13:31.810 --> 13:35.060
Say, do I smell bloody?

13:36.140 --> 13:40.610
So I shredded the
princess into ribbons.

13:57.170 --> 13:59.580
What did you do to Shigure?

14:00.420 --> 14:02.180
I told you.

14:02.210 --> 14:04.850
She's mincemeat.

14:04.880 --> 14:08.010
I had a blast.

14:18.480 --> 14:20.620
You do seem strong.

14:20.650 --> 14:22.980
I'm so looking forward to this.

14:32.030 --> 14:33.830
I'm so delighted, Jubei.

14:34.700 --> 14:40.830
It's so thrilling to be able to
fight someone as strong as you.

15:22.170 --> 15:24.000
So close.

15:27.380 --> 15:31.020
Even I have a hard
time handling it.

15:31.050 --> 15:32.550
What do you mean?

15:33.300 --> 15:37.020
We've known each
other for a long time, but

15:37.050 --> 15:41.230
this thing and I are
totally different entities.

15:45.440 --> 15:47.750
It's an irritating pest.

15:47.780 --> 15:49.030
Is that so?

15:54.570 --> 15:57.660
It is such an irritating pest.

15:58.620 --> 16:00.760
This scar on my belly,

16:00.790 --> 16:03.050
which the parasite
creature uses as an opening

16:03.080 --> 16:05.170
has been there ever
since I can remember.

16:57.090 --> 17:01.520
I tried to yank it out
myself but it was useless.

17:19.830 --> 17:24.590
Before long, I left home to
immerse myself in swordsmanship.

17:24.620 --> 17:30.170
So that someday, I could take care
of the parasite with my own hands.

17:34.300 --> 17:41.720
Problem is, it appears only when I'm
fighting with someone and am in danger.

17:47.190 --> 17:50.700
'Cause if the host
dies, so will the parasite.

17:50.730 --> 17:56.700
But that near-death moment is
the opportune moment to kill it.

18:09.880 --> 18:13.920
You can guess why
I told you this story.

18:14.840 --> 18:17.930
You want me to
take care of that pest.

18:18.930 --> 18:20.520
Right, right.

18:20.550 --> 18:24.030
I really need help to do this.

18:24.060 --> 18:26.810
Help from an especially
strong swordsman.

18:28.560 --> 18:30.270
You really are pushy!

18:30.860 --> 18:32.540
How wonderful.

18:32.570 --> 18:34.530
I'm looking forward to this.

19:07.930 --> 19:09.480
Don't be so mad.

19:10.520 --> 19:13.400
Here's a present
from your master Zofu.

19:34.540 --> 19:37.670
It's dead. We did it!

19:39.220 --> 19:43.180
You're an awesome
fighter, just as I thought.

19:45.300 --> 19:49.180
I never felt so
cheerful in all my life.

20:07.990 --> 20:10.750
Well, then, shall we
finish our business?

20:28.140 --> 20:29.810
Why?

20:31.890 --> 20:33.560
I see.

20:38.070 --> 20:45.200
It turns out that the parasite was
the host, and I was the parasite.

20:47.830 --> 20:53.410
I was able to live
because of the parasite.

20:57.590 --> 20:59.300
That's so cold.

21:08.600 --> 21:10.220
JubeL.

21:27.240 --> 21:29.160
That man died, didn't he?

21:30.030 --> 21:31.030
Yeah.

21:39.590 --> 21:46.400
Then, in the very last few moments of
his life, he was freed from that creature.

21:46.430 --> 21:51.890
Yeah. But as soon as he
got his freedom, he died.

23:29.990 --> 23:31.990
<i>Next Episode.</i>

23:33.740 --> 23:36.830
Jubei and Shigure have always
evaded the Kimon's attacks.

23:37.240 --> 23:40.220
But now they face
their leader, Yamidoro.

23:40.250 --> 23:44.010
However, a shinobi has escaped
prison in the Hiruko village.

23:44.040 --> 23:47.680
He has but one goal: to
meet his dearest Light Maiden.

23:47.710 --> 23:52.930
But Shigure has yet
to accept that title.

23:53.090 --> 23:56.510
Next time on Ninja Scroll:
The Heart of the Hiruko.

23:57.010 --> 23:58.360
<i>Episode 10 The Heart
of the Hiruko Witness.</i>

23:58.390 --> 24:01.310
<i>Episode 10 The
Heart of the Hiruko</i>
